  {
   "t": "p",
   "md": "Display in rem"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "md": "To ensure that the user’s default font size is followed, the base font size is defined as a percentage that grows with the user’s screen size, while HTML elements are defined in `rem`."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "md": "Since `rem` is a multiplier of the HTML document font size, all HTML element’s font sizes grow proportionally with the size of the user’s screen."
  },
