   "t": "h2",
   "text": "Headings",
   "id": "headings"
  },
  {
   "t": "example",
   "label": "Headings example",
   "demo": "<article aria-label=\"Headings example\" class=\"component\"><h1>Heading 1</h1><h2>Heading 2</h2><h3>Heading 3</h3><h4>Heading 4</h4><h5>Heading 5</h5><h6>Heading 6</h6></article>",
   "lang": "html",
   "code": "<h1>Heading 1</h1>\n<h2>Heading 2</h2>\n<h3>Heading 3</h3>\n<h4>Heading 4</h4>\n<h5>Heading 5</h5>\n<h6>Heading 6</h6>"
  },
  {
   "t": "h2",
   "text": "Heading group",
   "id": "heading-group"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "md": "Inside a `<hgroup>`, margins are collapsed, and the `:last-child` is muted."
  },
  {
   "t": "example",
   "label": "Headings example",
